<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id">- ZARAMO Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1WAKOLINTO</para>
  <para style="toc1">LUPWILILI LWA ICHANDUSO LWANDIKIGWE NA MTUMIGWA WA KILISTO PAULO HA WAKOLINTO</para>
  <para style="toc2">1WAKOLINTO</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Kol.</para>
  <para style="mt2">LUPWILILI LWA ICHANDUSO LWANDIKIGWE NA MTUMIGWA WA KILISTO PAULO HA</para>
  <para style="mt1">WAKOLINTO</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOZI</para>
  <para style="ip">Lupwilili lwa Ichanduso lwa Mtumigwa wa Kilisto Paulo ha Wakolinto lwandikigwa na mtumigwa wa Kilisto Paulo mmilao ya 55 songela viyavumbuke Kilisto (1:1). Luno lulo lupwilili lwa ichanduso mmhwilili mbili zitulinazo Paulo zayawandikile wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wakalile mdiwambo da Kolinto. Siku kandika lupwilili luno kipigiti viyakalile mdiwambo da Efeso, viyakalile mnzila yochola na kubwela muisi ya Makedonia kipigiti hanagesa kuchola Kolinto (16:5-9).</para>
  <para style="ip">Lupwilili luno lukala nyidikila ya mbuli ziyazibokele Paulo kulawa ha wanhu wayagwe wamtogole Kilisto zilonga mbuli bwando zihile zikalile zitendeka mwa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto kamba vija mbagu na ushalati. Wambo da Kolinto dikala ditangigwa ng'hani mmbuli ya ushalati avo hakikalile kinhu cha mkanganyo mbuli ino kulawilila mwa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wali mdiwambo dino. Lupwilili lwa Ichanduso lwa Wakolinto vivija luna sula itangigwe ng'hani, sula ilonga mbuli ya noge (13).</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali Mgati ya Ikitabu</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paulo kowalamsa Wakolinto na kumuheweza Mulungu sama yao (<char style="ior"><ref loc="1CO 1:1-9">1:1-9</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Abaho kozipeta mbuli za mbagu ziyazibokele mwa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wa Kolinto (<char style="ior"><ref loc="1CO 1:10-4:21">1:10—4:21</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Abaho kozipeta mbuli za ushalati na kuigala wenyego kwa wenyego kuna ivitala (<char style="ior"><ref loc="1CO 5-6">5—6</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Abaho kolava mafundo ga zengele, kulava nhosa ha miwegu, mating'hanilo ga nhambiko, nhunza za muloho, na mzuso (<char style="ior"><ref loc="1CO 7-15">7—15</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Hakimambukizo, kokomeleza na mbuli za sang'hano na mbuli zake mwenyego (<char style="ior"><ref loc="1CO 16">16</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Ndamsa Kulawa ha Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1"/>Lupwilili luno lolawa ha Paulo, mtumigwa wa Yesu Kilisto, yakemigwe na manogelwa ga Mulungu, na kulawa ha Sositene ndugu yetu.<verse eid="1CO 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2"/>Nowandikila wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wali mdiwambo da Kolinto, wali wanhu wa Mulungu mkuilumba hamoja na Yesu Kilisto, wakemigwe wawe wanhu wang'alile, hamoja na awo wose wali kila hanhu wodikema twaga da Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto, Mndewa wao na wetu.<verse eid="1CO 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3"/>Ngekewa na tindiwalo kulawa ha Mulungu Tata wetu na kulawa ha Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto viwe hamoja namwe.<verse eid="1CO 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo Komuheweza Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4"/>Nomuheweza Mulungu wangu mazua gose sama yenu, sama ya ngekewa ya Mulungu iyawagwelele mweye kubitila Yesu Kilisto. <verse eid="1CO 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5"/>Mkuilumba hamoja na Kilisto mgaluka wagoli m'vinhu vose, muulonzi wose na ilimu yose, <verse eid="1CO 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6"/>kwavija usindila wetu mmbuli ya Kilisto woneka mgati yenu. <verse eid="1CO 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7"/>Avo hamuhungukilwe nhunza yoyose ya muloho mbaka kipigiti kino vum'beta na sulukila kufunuligwa kwa Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto. <verse eid="1CO 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8"/>Vivija heyo iyo yondayawagele mhiko mbaka hakimambukizo, giladi sambimuwe na mbuli mdizua dija da kubwela Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto. <verse eid="1CO 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9"/>Mulungu kozindilila mbuli zake, na heyo iyo yawakemile muwe na udugu na mwanage, Yesu Kilisto Mndewa wetu.<verse eid="1CO 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuigola Mmwanza wa Wanhu Wamtogole Kilisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10"/>Nowayalalila mweye, ndugu zangu, mditwaga da Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto, kamba mweye mose muitogolele gaja gomulonga giladi sambikuwe na mbagu mmwanza wenu, avo muigoge ng'hani mnzewele na mngelegeza. <verse eid="1CO 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11"/>Kwavija wanhu kulawa mulango wa Kloe wanongela kamba kuna ngomba mmwanza wenu, mweye ndugu zangu. <verse eid="1CO 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12"/>Kinilonga nie icho kino, kila munhu kolonga jake. Ino kolonga, “Nie wa Paulo,” iyagwe, “Nie wa Apolo,” iyagwe, “Nie wa Petulo,” na iyagwe, “Nie wa Kilisto.” <verse eid="1CO 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13"/>Kilisto kaigola? Paulo iyo yawambigwe mumsalaba sama yenu? Mweye m'batizigwa mditwaga da Paulo?<verse eid="1CO 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14"/>Nomuheweza Mulungu kamba sim'batize munhu yoyose mmwanza wenu ila Kilisipo na Gayo, <verse eid="1CO 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15"/>avo haduhu munhu yondayadahe kulonga kamba m'batizigwa mditwaga jangu. <verse eid="1CO 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16"/>Ona! Vivija niubatiza mulango wa Stefana, ila sivitanga kamba nim'batiza munhu iyagwe. <verse eid="1CO 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17"/>Kwavija Kilisto handagize nie kubatiza. Ila kandagiza kuupeta Usenga Unogile, si na mbuli zili na ng'hungwe ya kiunhu, giladi msalaba wa Kilisto sambiusegezeligwe mhiko zake.<verse eid="1CO 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kilisto Iyo Mhiko na Ng'hungwe ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18"/>Kwavija usenga wa ifa ya Kilisto mumsalaba wokoneka ubozi ha awo wopotela, ila ha tweye tukomboligwe, usenga hiwo uwo mhiko ya Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19"/>Kwavija yandikigwa Mzinyandiko Zing'alile,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">“Noibananga ng'hungwe ya wabala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 1:19">na noibumbuwaza nzewele ya wene nzewele.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 29:14">ISAYA 29:14</ref></char>.</note><verse eid="1CO 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20"/>Kakwahi munhu ija yali m'bala? Kakwahi mfundiza Malagizo ga Musa? Kakwahi yali na mbamila mkipigiti kino? Mulungu kaitenda ng'hungwe ya ulumwengu uno iwe ubozi! <verse eid="1CO 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21"/>Kwavija Mulungu mng'hungwe yake katenda sambividahike wanhu kumtanga heyo mkubitila ng'hungwe yao wenyego. Ila mnzila ya usenga utuupeta, awo woukema, “ubozi,” Mulungu kasagula kuwakombola awo wotogola. <verse eid="1CO 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22"/>Wayahudi wolonda mizonza giladi watogole, na Wagiliki wozahila ng'hungwe. <verse eid="1CO 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23"/>Ila tweye tompeta Kilisto yawambigwe mumsalaba, mbuli ili king'hwaso mwa Wayahudi na ubozi mwa Wamhazi. <verse eid="1CO 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24"/>Ila ha awo wakemigwe na Mulungu, wose, Wayahudi na Wagiliki, Kilisto iyo mhiko ya Mulungu na ng'hungwe ya Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25"/>Kwavija kija kikoneka kuwa ubozi wa Mulungu kicho ubala kubanza ng'hungwe ya wanhu, na kulegela kwa Mulungu kowa mhiko ng'hulu ng'hani kubanza mhiko za wanhu.<verse eid="1CO 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26"/>Ndugu zangu, gelegezeni vija vumkalile kipigiti vumkemigwe na Mulungu. Si wanhu bwando mmwanza wenu mkalile wabala kuvikila ubala wa kiunhu, na si wanhu bwando mkalile na mhiko, na si wanhu bwando mkalile wagoli. <verse eid="1CO 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27"/>Ila Mulungu kagasagula gaja ulumwengu ugogesa kamba ga ubozi giladi kuwagela kinyala iwabala, na kagasagula gaja ulumwengu ugogesa kamba galegela giladi kuwagela kinyala waja wali na mhiko. <verse eid="1CO 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28"/>Mulungu kavisagula vinhu vili hasi ng'hani na vizabuzwe na wanhu muulumwengu uno, vinhu vilibule nhogolwa giladi kuvibananga vija vikoneka na wanhu kuwa na nhogolwa muulumwengu uno. <verse eid="1CO 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29"/>Avo munhu sambiyaitope haulongozi wa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30"/>Sama ya Mulungu mweye muilumba hamoja na Yesu Kilisto, ayo sama yetu tweye yagaluke ng'hungwe kulawa ha Mulungu, na katutenda tuwe bule uzenzeleganye, na kutung'aliza, na kutukombola. <verse eid="1CO 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31"/>Avo kamba viyandikigwe Mzinyandiko Zing'alile, “Munhu yoyose yahalonda kuitopa, yaitope mgati ya Mndewa.”<verse eid="1CO 1:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Usenga wa Kuwambigwa Kilisto Mumsalaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1"/>Ndugu zangu, kipigiti vunizile kumwenu kuipeta ikweli ya Mulungu iifisile, silongile mmahala ama m'vitega. <verse eid="1CO 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2"/>Kipigiti kiguhi kinikalile na mweye, nizitenda ngelegeza zangu sambizigelegeze kinhu chochose, ila Yesu Kilisto ayo yawambigwe mumsalaba. <verse eid="1CO 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3"/>Nie niza kumwenu kuno nilegele na kuno nidumba na kuno nigudema. <verse eid="1CO 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4"/>Usenga wangu na mafundo gangu hagakalile na ng'hungwe ya kiunhu ama mbuli zilimwilile, ila gakala na utango wa mhiko za Loho wa Mulungu, <verse eid="1CO 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5"/>giladi nhamanila yenu sambiikale mng'hungwe ya wanhu, ila mmhiko za Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ng'hungwe ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6"/>Hata avo noupeta usenga uli na ng'hungwe ha awo wakangale muloho. Ila sio ng'hungwe ya ulumwengu uno ama za watawala wa ulumwengu uno awo wohuha. <verse eid="1CO 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7"/>Ng'hungwe iniipeta iyo ng'hungwe ya Mulungu ifisike, ayo iyeshile kuisagula sama ya yenzi yetu songela ulumwengu haunalumbigwa. <verse eid="1CO 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8"/>Haduhu mtawala yoyose wa ulumwengu uno yaitangile ng'hungwe ino. Kamba wahaitangile, sambiwamuwambe mumsalaba Mndewa wa iyenzi. <verse eid="1CO 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9"/>Ila kamba viyandikigwe Mzinyandiko Zing'alile,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">“Gaja haganakoneka ama kuhulikwa na munhu yoyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">gaja haduhu munhu yagagesile kamba godaha kulawila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:9">gano gago Mulungu goyowagomela awo wamnogele.”<verse eid="1CO 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10"/>Ila mbuli zino Mulungu katugubulila tweye kubitila Loho wake. Kwavija Loho wake kozahila vinhu vose, hata mbuli za Mulungu ziifisile. <verse eid="1CO 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11"/>Kwavija haduhu munhu mmwanza wa wanhu yozitanga ngelegeza za miyage, ila loho wa munhu ija yali mgati yake iyo yodaha kuzitanga. Vivija haduhu munhu yozitanga ngelegeza za Mulungu ila Loho wa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12"/>Tweye hatum'bokele loho wa ulumwengu uno, ila tum'bokela Loho yolawa ha Mulungu, giladi tugatange gaja gayatugwelele Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13"/>Tozilonga mbuli zino, mmbuli hazilingile na zija zifundizwa na ng'hungwe ya wanhu, ila kamba zija zifundizigwa na Loho wa Mulungu, zigubula mbuli zili mgati ya Loho wa Mulungu mwa awo wali na Loho wa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14"/>Munhu yoyose yalibule Loho wa Mulungu hadaha kubokela nhunza zilawa ha Loho wa Mulungu. Kwavija kumwake heyo za kamba ubozi na hadaha kuzitanga, kwavija zomanyigwa muloho. <verse eid="1CO 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15"/>Munhu yoyose yali na Loho wa Mulungu kodaha kuvitagusa vinhu vose, ila heyo mwenyego hataguswa na munhu yoyose. <verse eid="1CO 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16"/>Kamba viyandikigwe Mzinyandiko Zing'alile,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:16">“Yalihi yozimanya ngelegeza za Mndewa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 2:16">Yalihi yodaha kumgwelela heyo masala?”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Ila tweye tozitanga mbuli zino, kwavija tuna ngelegeza za Kilisto.<verse eid="1CO 2:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Watumigwa wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1"/>Ndugu zangu, vunikalile hamoja na mweye sidahile kulonga na mweye kamba wanhu wa muloho, ila kamba wanhu wa ulumwengu, kamba wana wadodo muinhamanila ya Ukilisto. <verse eid="1CO 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2"/>Niwang'weza matombo, na sio mandia gazamile, kwavija mkala hamnavikila kuja mandia gazamile. Na hata sambi mng'hali hamnavikila kuja mandia gazamile, <verse eid="1CO 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3"/>kwavija mng'hali wanhu wa ulumwengu uno. Kamba kuna migongo na kugomba wenyego kwa wenyego, gano hagalagusa kamba mweye mwa wanhu wa ulumwengu uno, mkala kamba wanhu wa ulumwengu? <verse eid="1CO 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4"/>Ihawa imwe mmwanza wenu kolonga, “Nie wa Paulo,” na iyagwe, “Nie wa Apolo,” mweye si wanhu wa ulumwengu uno?<verse eid="1CO 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5"/>Tuhagaleka gano gose, niwauze, Apolo iyo yalihi? Na Paulo iyo yalihi? Tweye twa watumigwa wa Mulungu, awo wawalongoze mweye kutogola. Kila munhu mmwanza wetu kosang'hana sang'hano yaamgwelele Mndewa kuitenda. <verse eid="1CO 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6"/>Nie nihanda mbeyu, Apolo kagelela mazi, ila Mulungu iyo yokuza. <verse eid="1CO 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7"/>Ayo yohanda na ayo yogelela mazi wose si kinhu, ila Mulungu yeiyeka youtenda ukule. <verse eid="1CO 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8"/>Ayo yohanda na ayo yogelela mazi wose wali kinhu kimwe, na kila munhu kobokela kitumetume kilinga na sang'hano iyatendile. <verse eid="1CO 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9"/>Kwavija tweye twa wasang'hana wa Mulungu, tusang'hanika hamoja, na mweye mwa mgunda wa Mulungu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 3:9">Vivija mweye mwa ng'anda ya Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10"/>Sama ya bazi da Mulungu diyangwelele nie, niuzenga msingi kamba mzenzi yali galu, na munhu iyagwe kozenga uchana yake. Ila kila munhu yateganye vija voyozenga. <verse eid="1CO 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11"/>Kwavija haduhu munhu yodaha kwika msingi uyagwe mbali na uja wishile kwikigwa, na msingi hiwo uwo Yesu Kilisto. <verse eid="1CO 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12"/>Kamba munhu yoyose yahazenga mumsingi uno na zahabu, ama madini ga feza, ama mabwe ganogile ng'hani, ama mbao, ama mijani, ama mibelege, <verse eid="1CO 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13"/>sang'hano yake yokoneka kipigiti zua dondayabwele Kilisto vondadiigubule. Kwavija mdizua dija moto woigubula sang'hano ya kila munhu, na kuupima unovu wa sang'hano ya kila munhu. <verse eid="1CO 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14"/>Kamba kija kizengigwe uchana ya umsingi hakilukule, ija yazengile kobokela nhunza. <verse eid="1CO 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15"/>Ila sang'hano ya munhu yoyose ihalukula, ija yazengile kopata hasala, ila heyo mwenyego kokomboligwa kamba munhu yahonyokwe kubitila uja umoto.<verse eid="1CO 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16"/>Ham'vimanyile kamba mweye mwa Ng'anda ya Mulungu na kamba Loho wa Mulungu kokala mgati yenu? <verse eid="1CO 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17"/>Avo kamba munhu yoyose yahaibananga Ng'anda ya Mulungu, Mulungu kom'bananga munhu ija. Kwavija Ng'anda ya Mulungu ing'ala, na mweye wenyego mwa Ng'anda ya Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18"/>Sambiuibunyike mwenyego. Kamba uhagiza kamba kwa m'bala muulumwengu uno, kolondigwa ugaluke m'bozi, giladi uwe m'bala wa ikweli. <verse eid="1CO 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19"/>Kwavija ng'hungwe ya ulumwengu uno iyo ubozi haulongozi wa Mulungu. Kamba viyandikigwe Mzinyandiko Zing'alile, “Kawanamata iwabala muubala wao,” <verse eid="1CO 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20"/>na Mzinyandiko ziyagwe Zing'alile zolonga, “Mndewa kavimanya kamba ngelegeza za wanhu wabala, si kinhu.” <verse eid="1CO 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21"/>Avo munhu sambiyaitopele kinhu choyodaha kutenda munhu. Kwavija vinhu vose venu mweye, <verse eid="1CO 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22"/>kamba Paulo ama Apolo ama Petulo ama ulumwengu ama ugima ama ifa ama kipigiti kino ama kipigiti kikwiza. Gano gose genu mweye, <verse eid="1CO 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23"/>na mweye wa Kilisto, na Kilisto wa Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 3:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Watumigwa wa Kilisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1"/>Avo wanhu wolondigwa kutugelegeza tweye tuli watumigwa wa Kilisto, kamba wanhu watogoligwe kugweleligwa vinhu va Mulungu viifisile. <verse eid="1CO 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2"/>Kinhu kimwe kilondigwa ha watumigwa wano kicho kino, wolondigwa sambiwawe vizenzeleganye. <verse eid="1CO 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3"/>Ila kumwangu nie nna vinhu vidodo ng'hani vinilondigwa kutagusigwa na mweye, ama na kitala chochose cha kiunhu, na hata siitagusa mwenyego. <verse eid="1CO 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4"/>Udaho wangu wa kusambula gehile na ganogile ung'ala, ila dino hadinitenda niiyone kamba nabule vilozo kabisa. Mndewa iyo yondayanhaguse. <verse eid="1CO 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5"/>Avo sambimumtaguse munhu yoyose kamba kipigiti hakinavikila, beteni mbaka Mndewa yeheza. Heyo kogeka mmulangaza gaja gaifisile mdiziza, na kozigubula ngelegeza za mioyo ya wanhu. Mkipigiti hicho kila munhu kobokela nhogolwa yolondigwa kupata kulawa ha Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6"/>Avo, ndugu zangu, mbuli zino nizilinganyiza na nie na Apolo sama yenu giladi muifundize kumwetu nhegulo ya ulonzi uno ulonga, “Sambim'banze gaja gandikigwe,” giladi munhu yoyose mmwanza wenu sambiyaitopele munhu imwe na kumzabuza munhu iyagwe. <verse eid="1CO 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7"/>Yalihi yawatendile mweye kuwa wakulu wa waenu? Si heyo Mulungu yawagwelele vinhu vose vumulinavo? Avo habali muitopa kamba vija vimulinavo hamgweleligwe na Mulungu?<verse eid="1CO 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8"/>Mokwagiza mwisha kwing'higwa vinhu vose vumulonda? Mwisha kugaluka wagoli? Mwisha kugaluka wandewa hata kamba tweye hatuli wandewa? Vihanogile muhawile wandewa kweli giladi na tweye tuwe wandewa hamoja na mweye. <verse eid="1CO 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9"/>Kwavija kumwangu yokoneka kamba Mulungu katwika tweye watumigwa wa Kilisto wa hanhu haikimambukizo, kamba wanhu watagusigwe kudanganhika haulongozi wa wanhu kamba kinhu cha kulagusila ulumwengu mgima, wanhu na wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga. <verse eid="1CO 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10"/>Tweye twa wabozi sama ya Kilisto, ila mweye mwa wabala mkuilumba na Kilisto! Tweye tulegela, ila mweye muna mhiko! Tweye tozabuzwa, ila mweye mohishimilwa! <verse eid="1CO 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11"/>Mbaka kipigiti kino cha sambi tuna nzala na ng'hilu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mbaka kipigiti kino </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mbaka kipigiti Paulo viyandike lupwilili luno.</char></note> tovala vikumbi, totoigwa, twabule kae. <verse eid="1CO 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12"/>Togaya ng'hani mkusang'hanika na makono getu wenyego, na tuhadukumizwa, tweye towamoteza. Tuhagazigwa, tweye tokwazaganya. <verse eid="1CO 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13"/>Tuhalongigwa vihile, tokwidika mmbuli zinogile. Mbaka kipigiti kino<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mbaka kipigiti kino </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mbaka kipigiti Paulo viyandike lupwilili luno.</char></note> tugaluka unyolodo wa muisi ino na uvuludu wa ulumwengu!<verse eid="1CO 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14"/>Nowandikila gano sio kamba nolonda kuwatenda mweye mone kinyala, ila nowazuma kamba wanangu iniwanogele. <verse eid="1CO 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15"/>Hata kamba muhawa na wemilizi alufu longo dimwe muukazi wenu wa kuilumba hamoja na Kilisto, ila mwabule watata bwando, kwavija nie nigaluka tata wenu mkuilumba hamoja na Kilisto Yesu kubitila Usenga Unogile. <verse eid="1CO 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16"/>Avo nowayalalila, tendeni kamba vunitenda nie. <verse eid="1CO 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17"/>Sama ya mbuli ino nomgala Timoteo kumwenu, mwanangu inimnogele na yalibule uzenzeleganye mkuilumba na Mndewa. Heyo kowakumbusa ukazi wangu unikala hamoja na Yesu Kilisto, ulingile na gaja ganifundiza mwa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto kila hanhu.<verse eid="1CO 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18"/>Wanhu wayagwe mmwanza wenu wakiitopa kwavija wagiza kamba siza kumwenu. <verse eid="1CO 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19"/>Ila nokwiza kumwenu sambisambi kamba vihamnogela Mndewa, abaho nogatanga, sio gaja tu gowolonga wanhu wano wali na matopa, ila vivija nozitanga mhiko ziwalinazo. <verse eid="1CO 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20"/>Kwavija Undewa wa Mulungu hauli mmbuli zoyolonga munhu, ila vivija mzisang'hano za mhiko. <verse eid="1CO 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21"/>Monogelwa nize na choni? Nize na mbalati ama na noge na moyo uholile?<verse eid="1CO 4:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Ugoni Wowanyolodosa Wanhu Wamtogole Kilisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1"/>Kuna mbuli za kweli zilonga kamba kuna ugoni hagatigati yenu, ugoni wa namna hiyo haunakoneka hata mwa Wamhazi, munhu kutenda ugoni na mtwanzi wa tataake. <verse eid="1CO 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2"/>Na hata avo moitopa! Hamulondigwa kusudagala, na ija yatendile gano yasegezwe kulawa mmwenu? <verse eid="1CO 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3"/>Hata kamba sili hamoja namwe mulukuli, ila na hamoja namwe mngelegeza. Kamba vija nikala baho, nisha kumtagusa <verse eid="1CO 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4"/>mtwaga da Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto munhu yatendile gano. Muhaiting'hana hamoja, na nie na hamoja namwe muloho, na mhiko za Mndewa wetu Yesu zowa hamoja na tweye. <verse eid="1CO 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5"/>Abaho molondigwa mum'bagule munhu ino kulawa mmwanza wa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto, mumgwelele Mwenembago, giladi lukuli lwake lubanangigwe, na loho yake ikomboligwe mdizua dija vondayeze Mndewa Yesu.<verse eid="1CO 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6"/>Havinogile mweye kuitopa! Muutange ulonzi ulonga, “Mela dodo dotenda tonge jose da ngano kululumuka.” <verse eid="1CO 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7"/>Segezeni mela da umwaka da vilozo giladi muwe tonge da ngano da sambi dilibule mela kamba vija vimuli. Kwavija Kilisto, Mwana Ng'hondolo wetu wa Pasaka, kesha kulavigwa nhosa. <verse eid="1CO 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8"/>Kamba lusona lwa Pasaka vulukalile lutendigwa na mkate ulibule mela, avo natukale ukazi wa bila mela da mwaka, mela da vilozo na mbuli zihile, ila tuwe na ukazi ulibule mela, ukazi wa kuleka vilozo.<verse eid="1CO 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9"/>Niwandikila mulupwilili lwangu lubitile kamba, sambimuiduganye na wanhu wagoni. <verse eid="1CO 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10"/>Si kamba sambimuiduganye na wanhu wa ulumwengu uno wali wagoni ama wali wagila ama wabokonyi ama watambikila miwegu, kwavija kamba ihawile vino muhalondigwe msegele muulumwengu uno. <verse eid="1CO 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11"/>Ila sambi nie nowandikila kamba, sambimuiduganye na munhu yoyose yokiikema munhu yamtogole Kilisto na kuno kotenda ugoni ama mgila ama yotambikila miwegu ama mwene maligo ama mng'wa ugimbi ama m'bokonyi. Munhu kamba ino hamulondigwa hata kuja nayo.<verse eid="1CO 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12"/>Sang'hano yangu sio kuwatagusa awo walekile kumtogola Kilisto. Mweye molondigwa muwataguse awo wamtogole Kilisto. <verse eid="1CO 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:13"/>Mulungu kowalamula awo walekile kumtogola Kilisto. Kamba Nyandiko Zing'alile vuzilonga, “Muwingeni munhu yehile yalawe mmwenu.”<verse eid="1CO 5:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Nhaguso mwa Wanhu Wamtogole Kilisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1"/>Kamba munhu yoyose mmwanza wenu yahagomba na munhu miyage yamtogole Kilisto, kodaha vilihi kuchola ha walamula wa Kimhazi na kuleka kuchola ha wanhu wa Mulungu wang'alile? <verse eid="1CO 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2"/>Ham'vitangile kamba wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wawo wondawaulamule ulumwengu? Na kamba mweye moulamula ulumwengu, vilihi hamdaha kulamula mbuli ndodo? <verse eid="1CO 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3"/>Ham'vitangile kamba tweye towalamula wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga? Kamba vihawa vino modaha ng'hani kulamula mbuli za ugima uno! <verse eid="1CO 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4"/>Avo kamba muhagomba mmbuli zino ndodo, habali mzigala ha wanhu walekile hata kuhishimilwa hagatigati ya wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wawalamule? <verse eid="1CO 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5"/>Nogalonga gano giladi niwagele kinyala. Vino kweli haduhu hata munhu imwe mmwenu yali na ng'hungwe ya kulamula ngomba mwa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto? <verse eid="1CO 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6"/>Kinhu cha kukanganya, munhu yamtogole Kilisto komgala munhu miyage yamtogole Kilisto kukitala na kuwatenda Wamhazi walamule mbuli yake!<verse eid="1CO 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7"/>Kweli mbuli zino za wanhu wamtogole Kilisto wenyego kwa wenyego kuitagusila m'vitala zolagusa vija vimuhumwile kabisa. Havinogile ng'hani mweye kutendelwa gehile? Havinogile ng'hani mweye kubokonywa vinhu venu? <verse eid="1CO 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8"/>Kinhu cha kukanganya, mweye wenyego movwiza na kutenda gehile, na mogatenda gano mwa wanhu waenu wamtogole Kilisto! <verse eid="1CO 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9"/>Ham'vitangile kamba wanhu wotenda gehile hawauhala Undewa wa Mulungu? Sambimuibunyike wenyego. Wagoni, na watambikila miwegu, na wafutuzi, na wenekuigona wambigalo kwa wambigalo, na wambigalo wotenda uchuluzi wa kugonigwa, <verse eid="1CO 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10"/>na wabavi, na wagila, na wang'wa ugimbi, na wavwizi, na vizenzeleganye, haduhu hata imwe mmwanza wa wanhu wano yondayauhale Undewa wa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11"/>Na wayagwe mmwanza wenu mkala kamba vino, ila msuluzwa, abaho, mung'alizwa na mtendigwa wanhu walibule uzenzeleganye mtwaga da Mndewa Yesu Kilisto na Loho wa Mulungu wetu.<verse eid="1CO 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ng'huli Zenu Zimuyenzi Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12"/>Munhu kodaha kulonga, “Haduhu kinhu kili mwiko kumwangu.” Ila sio vinhu vose vinoga. Nie nodaha kulonga, “Haduhu kinhu kili mwiko kumwangu.” Ila nie sitogola kuwa nyakadala wa kinhu chochose. <verse eid="1CO 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13"/>“Mandia sama ya inda, na inda sama ya mandia.” Ila Mulungu kovibananga vose vibili. Lukuli halulumbigwe sama ya ugoni, ila lulumbigwa sama ya Mndewa, na Mndewa sama ya lukuli. <verse eid="1CO 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14"/>Na mhiko zake Mulungu kotuzusa tweye kulawa mkudanganhika, kamba viyamzusile Mndewa wetu kulawa mkudanganhika.<verse eid="1CO 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15"/>Ham'vitangile kamba ng'huli zenu vivo vipindi va lukuli lwa Kilisto? Nivisole vipindi va Kilisto nivilumbe hamoja na mtenda ugoni ndwanga? Havidahika! <verse eid="1CO 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16"/>Ham'vitangile kamba ayo yokiilumba mwenyego na mtenda ugoni ndwanga ka hamoja na heyo mulukuli? Kwavija yandikigwa Mzinyandiko Zing'alile, “Na wabili wano wowa lukuli lumwe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuli zino zolawa mkitabu cha </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">MWANDUSO 2:24</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="1CO 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17"/>Ila ayo yokiilumba mwenyego na Mndewa ka hamoja na heyo muloho.<verse eid="1CO 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18"/>Ukimbileni ugoni. Vilozo vose viyagwe voyotenda munhu va hanze ya lukuli lwake, ila munhu yotenda ugoni koloza mulukuli lwake mwenyego. <verse eid="1CO 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19"/>Ham'vimanyile kamba ng'huli zenu zizo Ng'anda ya Loho wa Mulungu yali mgati yenu, ayo yumum'bokele kulawa ha Mulungu? Na sio ng'huli zenu mweye wenyego. <verse eid="1CO 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20"/>Kawagula na beyu ng'hulu. Avo mmuyenzi Mulungu na ng'huli zenu.<verse eid="1CO 6:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Mbuza za Kusola na Kusoligwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1"/>Avo tanhu tuzilole mbuza zija zimunyandikile.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 7:1">Vinoga mbigalo sambiyasole mtwanzi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Sambiyasole mtwanzi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">sambiyawase na mtwanzi.</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2"/>Ila kwavija kuna mbuli bwando za ugoni, kila mbigalo na yawe na mwehe wake mwenyego, na kila mtwanzi na yawe na mbigalo wake mwenyego. <verse eid="1CO 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3"/>Mbigalo yamtendele mwehe wake gaja goyolondigwa kutendeligwa mng'anda, na vivija mwehe yatende vivo ha mbigalo wake. <verse eid="1CO 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4"/>Mwehe kabule udaho mulukuli lwake mwenyego, ila mbigalo wake, vivija mbigalo kabule udaho mulukuli lwake mwenyego, ila mwehe wake. <verse eid="1CO 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5"/>Sambimuiime, ila kamba muitogolela kwika kipigiti kiguhi cha kuinega giladi mpate kutambika, abaho m'bwele hamoja kabili, giladi Mwenembago sambiyawengize m'vitega sama ya kuhumwa kuizuila.<verse eid="1CO 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6"/>Nowalongela gano si kamba shuluti, ila kamba vinigelegeza nie. <verse eid="1CO 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7"/>Ila vinilonda nie wanhu wose wawe kamba vinili nie. Ila kila munhu kana nhunza yake yaagweleligwe na Mulungu, ino kana ino, na iyagwe kana ija.<verse eid="1CO 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8"/>Mmbuli ya awo wali wagane na vizuka nolonga kamba vihanogile kumwao kukala ugane kamba vinili nie. <verse eid="1CO 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9"/>Ila kamba hawadaha kuizuila, basi nawasole ama kusoligwa, kwavija vinoga kusola ama kusoligwa kubanza kulukula na usu da ugoni.<verse eid="1CO 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10"/>Mwa wanhu wasolile ama wasoligwe, nowagwelela ndagizi ino, sio ndagizi yangu ila ndagizi ya Mndewa kamba, mwehe sambiyamwase mbigalo wake, <verse eid="1CO 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11"/>ila kamba yahamwasa, kolondigwa yakale bila kusoligwa, ama yabwezigwe kumzengo na mbigalo wake. Na mbigalo sambiyamwase mwehe wake.<verse eid="1CO 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12"/>Mwa wasigale nolonga vino, hano nolonga nie sio Mndewa, kamba mbigalo yamtogole Kilisto kana mwehe yalekile kumtogola Kilisto, na ija imwehe katogola kukala na heyo, sambiyamwase. <verse eid="1CO 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13"/>Na kamba mtwanzi yamtogole Kilisto kana mbigalo yalekile kumtogola Kilisto, na ija imbigalo katogola kukala na heyo, sambiyamwase. <verse eid="1CO 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14"/>Kwavija mbigalo yalekile kumtogola Kilisto kong'alizwa kubitila mwehe wake yamtogole Kilisto, na mwehe yalekile kumtogola Kilisto kong'alizwa kubitila mbigalo wake yamtogole Kilisto. Kamba vihalekile kuwa vino, wanenu wahawile kamba wana wa Wamhazi. Ila sama ya mbuli ino, watogoligwa na Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15"/>Ila kamba ija yalekile kumtogola Kilisto yahamwasa miyage yamtogole Kilisto, muleke yamwase. Ila mmbuli kamba ino mbigalo yamtogole Kilisto ama mtwanzi yamtogole Kilisto hazuilwa. Mulungu katukema tukale mditindiwalo. <verse eid="1CO 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16"/>Kovitangaze gweye, mwehe umtogole Kilisto, kamba siku komkombola mbigalo wako? Ama kovitangaze gweye, mbigalo umtogole Kilisto, kamba siku komkombola mwehe wako?<verse eid="1CO 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sigaleni Kamba Vumkemigwe na Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17"/>Ila kila munhu mmwanza wenu yagendelele kukala kamba Mndewa viyamulondile yakale, na kamba Mulungu viyamkemile. Dino dijo lagizo jangu dinifundiza mwa wanhu wose wamtogole Kilisto. <verse eid="1CO 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18"/>Kamba munhu yahakemigwa kuno yeshile kwingila kumbi, sambiyazahile kuisegeza ng'hovu yake ya kwingila kumbi. Na kamba munhu yahakemigwa kuno hanakwingila kumbi, halondigwa kwingila kumbi. <verse eid="1CO 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19"/>Kwingila kumbi ama kuleka kwingila kumbi si kinhu, ila kinhu kilondigwa kuzigoga ndagizi za Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20"/>Kila munhu yasigale na hali yaakalile nayo mkipigiti viyakemigwe na Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21"/>Gweye kukala nyakadala kipigiti vuukemigwe na Mulungu? Haduhu mbuli! Ila kamba uhawa na nzila ya kutenda giladi uilegehe, tenda avo. <verse eid="1CO 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22"/>Kwavija munhu yakalile nyakadala kipigiti viyakemigwe na Mndewa, heyo ha Mndewa ka munhu yailegehe, vivija heyo yakalile yailegehe kipigiti viyakemigwe, ka nyakadala wa Kilisto. <verse eid="1CO 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23"/>Kilisto kawagula mweye na beyu ng'hulu, avo sambimgaluke nyakadala wa wanhu. <verse eid="1CO 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24"/>Ndugu zangu, muhali yoyose imkemigwe sigaleni na Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbuza za Wagane na Vizuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25"/>Tuilole mbuli ya wagane imnyandikile. Nabule ndagizi kulawa ha Mndewa, ila nolava ngelegeza zangu kamba munhu yoneligwe bazi na Mndewa, nigweleligwe mhome ya kutogolwa.<verse eid="1CO 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26"/>Sama ya migayo ili sambi, vinoga mweye mkale kamba vimuli. <verse eid="1CO 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27"/>Kusola mwehe? Sambiulonde kumwasa. Hunasola? Sambiuzahile mwehe. <verse eid="1CO 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28"/>Ila kamba uhasola, hutendile vilozo, na kamba mndele yahasoligwa, hatendile vilozo. Ila nolonda mgatange gano, kamba awo wosola na kusoligwa wokwiza kugaya ng'hani muulumwengu uno, ila nie nolonda sambigawavike gano.<verse eid="1CO 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29"/>Ndugu zangu, nhegulo yake choni mbuli ino? Nhegulo yake iyo ino, kamba kisigala kipigiti kidodo. Avo songela kipigiti kino na kugendelela, awo wali na watwanzi wolondigwa wakale kamba vija wabule watwanzi, <verse eid="1CO 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30"/>awo wolila wakale kamba vija wabule giogio, awo wodeng'ha wakale kamba vija hawadeng'ha, awo wogula vinhu wakale kamba vija wabule kinhu, <verse eid="1CO 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31"/>na awo wosang'hanika na vinhu va ulumwengu sambiwavinanahile.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mnhongo wa 29 mbaka wa 31 nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Wehe, giogio, ndeng'ha, na ugoli sambiviwatende wanhu sambiwamsang'hanikile Mulungu.</char></note> Kwavija ulumwengu uno ukoneka sambi haukala gunge na gunge.<verse eid="1CO 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32"/>Nowalonda mweye sambimgaye mkugelegeza mmioyo. Mmwanza wa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto, mbigalo yali mgane kogaya mkugelegeza mbuli za Mndewa, vija vondayamnogeze Mndewa. <verse eid="1CO 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33"/>Ila mbigalo yali na mwehe kogaya mkugelegeza mbuli za ulumwengu uno, vija vondayamnogeze mwehe wake, <verse eid="1CO 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34"/>avo ngelegeza zake zokiigola mianza mibili. Vivija na mtwanzi yali mgane ama mhambe, kogaya mkugelegeza mbuli za Mndewa, kwavija kosulukila yamnogeze Mndewa mulukuli na muloho. Ila mtwanzi yasoligwe kogaya mkugelegeza mbuli za ulumwengu uno, vija vondayamnogeze mbigalo wake.<verse eid="1CO 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35"/>Nolonga gano sama ya kuwataza mweye, si kamba nolonda niwekile king'hwaso, ila nolonda mkale muinzila imnogele Mulungu ya kumtambikila Mndewa nhambiko ilibule mbagu.<verse eid="1CO 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36"/>Kamba munhu yahagesa kamba hatenda vinogile ha mhambe yolonda kumsola, na kamba ngelegeza zake zose za ha ija imhambe, na kogesa kamba kolondigwa yamsole, nayamsole. Hatenda vilozo, wolondigwa waisole. <verse eid="1CO 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37"/>Ila kamba munhu bila kushulutizwa kagimbula kumsola ija imhambe kulawa mngelegeza zake mwenyego, na kuzihuma ngelegeza zake mwenyego, avo kotenda vinogile yahaleka kumsola. <verse eid="1CO 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38"/>Avo ayo yondayamsole mkasano wake kotenda vinogile, ila ayo yogimbula kumsola mkasano wake vivija na heyo kotenda vinogile ng'hani.<verse eid="1CO 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39"/>Mtwanzi ka mkifungo cha mbigalo wake kipigiti mbigalo wake yang'hali mgima, ila kamba mbigalo wake yahadanganhika, kailegeha na kodaha kusoligwa na munhu yoyose yoomulonda, muladi yawe munhu yamtogole Kilisto. <verse eid="1CO 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40"/>Mngelegeza zangu vihanogile kumwake kukala ugane. Na nogelegeza kamba na nie vivija nna Loho wa Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 7:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Mbuza ya Kuilavila Miwegu Nhosa ya Nyama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1"/>Avo tuilole mbuza ija imnyandikile ya nyama ilavigwe nhosa ha miwegu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 8:1">Tuvitanga kamba tweye tose tuna ilimu, ila ilimu yotutenda tuwe na matopa, ila noge dogela mhiko. <verse eid="1CO 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2"/>Munhu yokwagiza koitanga goya mbuli, hanaitanga kamba vija voyolondigwa kuitanga. <verse eid="1CO 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3"/>Ila munhu yomnogela Mulungu, kotangigwa na Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4"/>Avo tuilole mbuli ya kuja nyama ilavigwe nhosa ha miwegu. Tuvitanga kamba wegu si kinhu kabisa muulumwengu uno, na haduhu Mulungu iyagwe ila imwe yeiyeka. <verse eid="1CO 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5"/>Hata kamba hana ija ikemigwa mizimu, kamba kuulanga ama muisi, kweli hana mizimu bwando na wandewa bwando, <verse eid="1CO 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6"/>ila tweye tuna Mulungu imwe yeiyeka, Tata, yalumbile vinhu vose, na sama yake heyo tweye tuna ugima. Na hana Mndewa imwe yeiyeka, Yesu Kilisto, mkubitila heyo vinhu vose vilumbigwa, na mkubitila heyo tweye tuna ugima.<verse eid="1CO 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7"/>Ila si wanhu wose woitanga kweli ino. Wanhu wayagwe wakala woisang'hanikila miwegu avo mbaka lelo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:7 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mbaka lelo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mbaka kipigiti Paulo viyandike lupwilili luno.</char></note> wahaja nyama wogelegeza kamba woja nyama ija iwakalile woilava nhosa ha miwegu, na kwavija udaho wao wa kusambula gehile na ganogile mdodo, wonyolodoka. <verse eid="1CO 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8"/>Ila mandia hagatukwenhusa behi na Mulungu, tuhaleka kuja hatwasa kinhu chochose, na tuhaja hatupata kinhu chochose.<verse eid="1CO 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9"/>Teganyeni, sang'hano za ulegeho umulinao, sambizigaluke king'hwaso ha awo wanyekile muinhamanila. <verse eid="1CO 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10"/>Kamba munhu yali na udaho mdodo wa kusambula gehile na ganogile kokona gweye uli na ilimu ino uja mng'anda ya miwegu, kokwagiza mbuli ino haimgela mhiko yagendelele kuja vakuja vija vilavigwe nhosa ha miwegu? <verse eid="1CO 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11"/>Avo ndugu yako ino yali na udaho mdodo wa kusambula gehile na ganogile, ayo Kilisto yadanganhike sama yake, kopotela sama ya ilimu yako. <verse eid="1CO 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12"/>Kamba uhawatendela vilozo na kuwagela milonda wanhu waenu wamtogole Kilisto, wali na udaho mdodo wa kusambula gehile na ganogile, kumtendela vilozo Kilisto. <verse eid="1CO 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13"/>Avo kamba kija kinija chomtenda ndugu yangu yengile m'vilozo, basi noleka kuja nyama giladi sambinimtende heyo yatende vilozo.<verse eid="1CO 8:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Sang'hano za Mtumigwa wa Kilisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1"/>Nie siilegehe? Nie sili mtumigwa wa Kilisto? Nie simonile Mndewa wetu Yesu? Mweye hamuli malawililo ga sang'hano yangu inimsang'hanikile Mndewa? <verse eid="1CO 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2"/>Hata kamba nie sili mtumigwa wa Kilisto mwa wanhu wayagwe, ila nie na mtumigwa wa Kilisto kumwenu. Kwavija mweye mwa kilaguso cha utumigwa wangu mkuilumba hamoja na Mndewa.<verse eid="1CO 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3"/>Ino iyo mbuli yondaniwalongele awo wondawanibeze. <verse eid="1CO 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4"/>Tweye hatulumbile kugweleligwa vakuja na vinhu va kung'wa sama ya sang'hano yetu? <verse eid="1CO 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5"/>Tweye hatulumbile kuilongoza na mwehe yamtogole Kilisto mmianza yetu kamba watumigwa wayagwe wa Kilisto na wandugu wa Mndewa na Petulo viwatendile? <verse eid="1CO 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6"/>Ama nie na Banaba twiyeka iwo tulondigwa tusang'hanike wenyego mmbuli za ugima wetu? <verse eid="1CO 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7"/>Yalihi yosang'hanika na sang'hano ya uasikali bila kulonda maliho? Yalihi yali na mgunda wa zabibu yoleka kuja mujo wake? Yalihi yali na dale da ng'hondolo yoleka kung'wa matombo gake?<verse eid="1CO 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8"/>Nie nolonga gano mngelegeza za kiunhu? Malagizo ga Musa hagalonga gago? <verse eid="1CO 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9"/>Kwavija yandikigwa Mmalagizo ga Musa kamba, “sambiumfunge ng'ombe mulomo kipigiti yahahugusa muhindi mkuubojaga.” Avo hano Mulungu kolonga mbuli ya ng'ombe? <verse eid="1CO 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10"/>Kweli hano Mulungu halonga mbuli zino sama yetu? Kweli mbuli zino zandikigwa sama yetu. Kwavija mulimi na ayo yohuna wolondigwa watende vino mkutamanila kuigolela fungu da vakuja. <verse eid="1CO 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11"/>Kamba tuhahanda mbeyu inogile ya muloho mmwenu, yowa mbuli ng'hulu kamba tuhahuna vinhu va mulukuli kulawa mmwenu? <verse eid="1CO 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12"/>Kamba watumigwa wayagwe wa Mulungu wolondigwa kutazigwa na mweye, avo tweye hatulondigwa ng'hani kutazigwa na mweye?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Ila hatulondile kutazigwa, twazaganya kila kinhu giladi sambitwike ving'hwaso muna inzila ya Usenga Unogile wa Kilisto. <verse eid="1CO 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13"/>Ham'vimanyile kamba awo wosang'hanika Kung'anda ya Mulungu wopata vakuja vao kulawa himo? Na awo wosang'hanika na kulava nhosa hakilingo cha kulavila nhosa wopata fungu kulawa m'vinhu vija vilavigwa nhosa? <verse eid="1CO 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14"/>Vivija, Mndewa kalagiza kamba awo woupeta Usenga Unogile wolondigwa watamanile kupata vinhu va kulutenda lukuli lupate ugima kulawa Muusenga Unogile.<verse eid="1CO 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15"/>Hata avo haduhu hata mbuli imwe iniisang'hanikile mmwanza wa mbuli zino zinilumbile nie kuzipata. Na sandike gano giladi nitamanile kamba munitendele nie mbuli zino. Vinoga nie nidanganhike kubanza munhu yanisegezele nafasi yangu ya kuitopa. <verse eid="1CO 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16"/>Hata avo nihaupeta Usenga Unogile, sidaha kuitopa, kwavija nishulutizwa kuupeta. Na kamba siupetile Usenga Unogile, nojona! <verse eid="1CO 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17"/>Kamba nihaisagule sang'hano ino mkulonda mwenyego, nihatamanile maliho. Ila kamba siisagule mkulonda mwenyego, noitenda kamba sang'hano yangu yaanondile Mulungu niitende. <verse eid="1CO 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18"/>Avo maliho gangu choni? Maliho gangu igo gano, mhome ya kuupeta Usenga Unogile bila kulonda kinhu, bila kulola gaja ganilondigwa kupata msang'hano yangu ya Usenga Unogile.<verse eid="1CO 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19"/>Hata kamba nie sili nyakadala wa munhu yoyose, ila noitenda nene mwenyego niwe nyakadala wa wanhu wose, giladi nimgalile wanhu bwando Kilisto kamba vihadahika. <verse eid="1CO 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20"/>Mwa Wayahudi, nikala kamba Muyahudi giladi niwagale Wayahudi ha Kilisto. Mwa awo wowinza Malagizo ga Musa, nikala kamba imwe wa awo wowinza Malagizo ga Musa, hata kamba nie sigawinza Malagizo ga Musa, giladi niwagale ha Kilisto awo wowinza Malagizo ga Musa. <verse eid="1CO 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21"/>Mwa awo walekile kufungigwa na Malagizo ga Musa, nikala kamba munhu yalekile kufungigwa na Malagizo ga Musa, hata kamba nie sifunguligwe kulawa Mmalagizo ga Mulungu, kwavija nie nifungigwa na Malagizo ga Kilisto, giladi niwagale ha Kilisto awo walekile kufungigwa na Malagizo ga Musa. <verse eid="1CO 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22"/>Mwa awo wanyekile muinhamanila, nikala kamba munhu yanyekile, giladi niwagale ha Kilisto awo wanyekile. Nigaluka vinhu vose mwa wanhu wose, giladi mnzila yoyose wayagwe wakomboligwe. <verse eid="1CO 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23"/>Nigatenda gano gose sama ya Usenga Unogile, giladi na nie mhate fungu da motelo zake.<verse eid="1CO 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24"/>Ham'vitangile kamba hali na mkimbilo, wanhu bwando wokimbila, ila imwe yeiyeka iyo yogweleligwa nhunza? Kimbileni kamba avo, giladi mgweleligwe nhunza. <verse eid="1CO 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25"/>Kila munhu yozahila kuhuma koizuila mkutenda vinhu bwando. Wotenda vino giladi wagweleligwe nhunza ibanangika, ila tweye totenda vino giladi tugweleligwe nhunza yondaikale milongo yose. <verse eid="1CO 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26"/>Avo nie sikimbila kamba munhu ija yokimbila bila kutamanila kinhu. Nie sitoa ng'honde kamba munhu ija yotoa ng'honde ubeho. <verse eid="1CO 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27"/>Nolugaza lukuli lwangu na kulutenda nyakadala wangu, giladi nihawapetela wayagwe Usenga Unogile na nie mwenyego sambinilemigwe.<verse eid="1CO 9:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Nzuma ha awo Wotambikila Miwegu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1"/>Ndugu zangu, nolonda mkumbuke kamba wahenga zetu wose wakala hasi ya wimilizi wa dija idiwingu, na wose waikanhiza Ibahali Indung'hu. <verse eid="1CO 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2"/>Wose wakala wabatizigwe mgati ya dija idiwingu na ija ibahali giladi wawe wanahina wa Musa. <verse eid="1CO 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3"/>Wose waja mandia gagaja ga muloho, <verse eid="1CO 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4"/>na kung'wa ung'waji uuja wa muloho, kwavija wang'wa mazi galawile mdidibwe dija da muloho ditembele hamoja na hewo, na dibwe dija dikala Kilisto. <verse eid="1CO 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5"/>Ila hata avo wanhu bwando mmwanza wao Mulungu hanogelwe na hewo, avo mitufi yao ipwililika muluwala.<verse eid="1CO 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6"/>Avo mbuli zino zose zizo kilingilo chetu tweye cha kutuzuma sambitusulukile vinhu vihile kamba viwatendile hewo, <verse eid="1CO 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7"/>na vivija sambitutambikile miwegu kamba viwakalile wotenda wanhu wayagwe mmwanza wao, kamba viyandikigwe Mzinyandiko Zing'alile, “Wanhu wakala hasi woja na kung'wa, abaho, wenuka wacheze.” <verse eid="1CO 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8"/>Na sambitutende ugoni kamba wayagwe mmwanza wao viwatendile, na sama ya mbuli ino wanhu alufu malongo mabili na ndatu (23,000) mmwanza wao wadanganhika mdizua dimwe. <verse eid="1CO 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9"/>Sambitumgeze Mndewa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:9 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mndewa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mnyandiko ziyagwe zomkema </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Kilisto.</char></note> kamba wayagwe mmwanza wao viwatendile, na sama ya mbuli ino wadanganhika mkulumizwa na nyoka. <verse eid="1CO 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10"/>Na sambimtwanganike kamba wanhu wayagwe mmwanza wao viwatendile, na sama ya mbuli ino wakomigwa na msenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga wa ubananzi.<verse eid="1CO 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11"/>Mbuli zino zose ziwalawilila wahenga zetu kamba vilingilo ha wanhu wayagwe, na mbuli zino zandikigwa kamba nzuma kumwetu tweye. Kwavija tokala mkipigiti kino kili behi na isota.<verse eid="1CO 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12"/>Avo kamba muhagiza mwima goya, mteganye sambimugwe. <verse eid="1CO 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13"/>Haduhu ving'hwaso viwapatile mweye ila vija viwapataga wanhu wose. Na Mulungu haisemwaga kilagano chake, hawaleka mweye mpate ving'hwaso kubita vija vumdaha. Ila muhapata ving'hwaso, Mulungu kotenda nzila ya kulawila, giladi mdahe kuvihuma.<verse eid="1CO 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14"/>Avo, mbwiga zangu wanogelwa, ikimbileni nhambiko ya miwegu. <verse eid="1CO 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15"/>Nolonga na wanhu wali na nzewele, lamuleni wenyego gano gonilonga. <verse eid="1CO 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16"/>Tuhamuheweza Mulungu sama ya kikasi kuna imeza ya Mndewa, hatuilumba hamoja na mulopa wa Kilisto? Na tuhaumogola umkate, hatuilumba hamoja na lukuli lwa Kilisto? <verse eid="1CO 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17"/>Kwavija kuna mkate umwe, tweye tose hata kamba twa bwando, twa lukuli lumwe, kwavija tweye tose tuja mkate umwe.<verse eid="1CO 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18"/>Wagelegezeni wanhu wa Islaeli, awo woja vinhu vilavigwe nhosa. Wabule uhamoja na ikilingo cha kulavila nhosa? <verse eid="1CO 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19"/>Kinilonda kulonga icho kino. Kinhu kilavigwa nhosa ha miwegu kina unozi? Ama miwegu ina unozi? <verse eid="1CO 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20"/>Si vivo, ila nhosa ya wamhazi yolavigwa ha vinyamkela sio ha Mulungu, na nie silonda mweye muwe na uhamoja na vinyamkela. <verse eid="1CO 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21"/>Hamdaha kung'wela kikasi king'welagwa mmandia ga Mndewa kuno mking'wela kikasi king'welagwa mnhambiko ya vinyamkela. Vivija hamdaha kuja mmeza ya mandia ga Mndewa kuno muja mmeza ya mnhambiko ya vinyamkela. <verse eid="1CO 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22"/>Ama tolonda tuwinule wivu wa Mndewa? Tweye tuna mhiko kubanza heyo?<verse eid="1CO 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23"/>Mweye molonga, “Vinhu vose havigomeswe,” ila nie nolonga, “Sio kila kinhu kinoga.” Mweye molonga, “Vinhu vose havigomeswe,” ila nie nolonga, “Sio kila kinhu chozenga.” <verse eid="1CO 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24"/>Munhu yoyose sambiyagese mbuli zake mwenyego yeiyeka, ila yagese na mbuli za wayage.<verse eid="1CO 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25"/>Dieni kinhu chochose kiguzigwa hasoko, sambimwinule mbuza kulawa muudaho wenu wa kusambula gehile na ganogile. <verse eid="1CO 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26"/>Kwavija Nyandiko Zing'alile zolonga, “Isi na vose viimemeze va Mndewa.”<verse eid="1CO 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27"/>Kamba Mmhazi yahawagoneka mkaje mandia, na mweye mtogola kuchola, dieni chochose chondayawagomele sambimwinule mbuza kulawa muudaho wenu wa kusambula gehile na ganogile. <verse eid="1CO 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28"/>Ila kamba munhu yahawalongela kamba, “Nyama ino ilavigwa nhosa ha miwegu,” sambimuije nyama ija, sama ya ija yawalongele na sama ya udaho wa kusambula gehile na ganogile, <verse eid="1CO 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29"/>kinilonga nie, udaho wa ija imunhu iyagwe wa kusambula gehile na ganogile na sio udaho wenu mweye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 10:29">Avo habali ulegeho wangu ulamulwe na udaho wa kusambula gehile na ganogile wa munhu iyagwe? <verse eid="1CO 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30"/>Kamba nihamuheweza Mulungu sama ya mandia, habali nidununzwe sama ya mandia ganimuhewezela Mulungu?<verse eid="1CO 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31"/>Avo muhaja ama muhang'wa ama muhatenda kinhu chochose, tendeni gose muyenzi ya Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32"/>Sambimsongeze king'hwaso ha munhu yoyose, ha Wayahudi ama ha Wagiliki ama ha wanhu wamtogole Mulungu, <verse eid="1CO 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33"/>kamba nie vinigeza kuwatendela ganogile wanhu wose, mmbuli zose vinitendile. Kwavija nie sizahile nhogolwa yangu mwenyego, ila nhogolwa ya wanhu bwando, giladi wakomboligwe.<verse eid="1CO 10:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11"/>
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1"/>Munige nie, kamba nie vunimwiga Kilisto.<verse eid="1CO 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kugubika Ditwi Mkipigiti cha Kutambika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2"/>Nie nowatogola mweye kwavija vumng'humbuka nie m'vinhu vose, na vija vumgagoga mafundo gangu, kamba vija viniwafundize. <verse eid="1CO 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3"/>Avo nowalonda mweye m'vitange kamba Kilisto iyo ditwi da kila mbigalo, mbigalo iyo ditwi da kila mtwanzi, na Mulungu iyo ditwi da Kilisto. <verse eid="1CO 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4"/>Mbigalo yoyose yotambika ama yohokola kuno ditwi jake digubikigwe komgela kinyala Kilisto, ayo yali ditwi. <verse eid="1CO 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5"/>Na mtwanzi yoyose yotambika ama yohokola bila kugubika ditwi jake komgela kinyala mbigalo wake, ayo yali ditwi, kwavija kowa kamba mtwanzi yabeigwe. <verse eid="1CO 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6"/>Kamba mtwanzi hagubika ditwi jake, nayakanhigwe mvili zake. Na kamba ihawa kinyala mtwanzi kukanhigwa mvili zake ama kubeigwa, basi yagubike ditwi jake. <verse eid="1CO 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7"/>Mbigalo halondigwa kugubika ditwi jake kwavija heyo iyo sisila na yenzi ya Mulungu, ila mtwanzi iyo yenzi ya mbigalo wake. <verse eid="1CO 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8"/>Kwavija mbigalo halumbigwe kulawa mwa mtwanzi, ila mtwanzi kalumbigwa kulawa mwa mbigalo. <verse eid="1CO 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9"/>Vivija mbigalo halumbigwe sama ya mtwanzi, ila mtwanzi iyo yalumbigwe sama ya mbigalo. <verse eid="1CO 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10"/>Sama ya mbuli ino na sama ya wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga, mtwanzi kolondigwa yawe na kigubiko mditwi jake kulagusa kamba ka hasi ya udaho wa mbigalo wake. <verse eid="1CO 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11"/>Ila mwa wanhu wa Mndewa, mtwanzi havidahika kuwa yeiyeka bila mbigalo, na mbigalo havidahika kuwa yeiyeka bila mtwanzi. <verse eid="1CO 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12"/>Kamba vija mtwanzi viyalawile mwa mbigalo, vivija na mbigalo kaleligwa na mtwanzi. Ila vinhu vose volawa ha Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13"/>Lamuleni wenyego, vinoga mtwanzi kumtambikila Mulungu kuno yalekile kugubika ditwi jake? <verse eid="1CO 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14"/>Vija Mulungu viyalumbile vinhu haiwafundiza mweye kamba mbigalo yahawa na mvili nhali koigela kinyala mwenyego, <verse eid="1CO 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15"/>ila kamba mtwanzi yahawa na mvili nhali, hiyo iyo yenzi yake. Kwavija mtwanzi kagweleligwa mvili nhali giladi ziwe kigubiko. <verse eid="1CO 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16"/>Ila kamba munhu yoyose yahalonda tuibamilile mmbuli ino, nolonda nilonge vino, tweye twabule nzila iyagwe ya kutambika, mmwetu tweye ama mwa wanhu wamtogole Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mandia ga Mndewa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">Mat. 26:26-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">Mlk. 14:22-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk. 22:14-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17"/>Mzindagizi zino, silonda niwatogole, kwavija mmating'hanilo genu ga nhambiko motenda gehile bwando kubanza ganogile. <verse eid="1CO 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18"/>Mosi nilongeligwa kamba muhaiting'hana mweye kamba wanhu wamtogole Kilisto, moibagula mwemwe kwa mwemwe, na nie kidogo notogola. <verse eid="1CO 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19"/>Haduhu mbuli, kolondigwa kuwe na mbagu mmwenu giladi yoneke kamba yalihi mmwenu yamtogole Mulungu kulawa mmoyo. <verse eid="1CO 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20"/>Muhaiting'hana hamoja, kija kimja sio mandia ga Mndewa. <verse eid="1CO 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21"/>Kwavija muhaja, kila munhu kogendelela kuja mandia gake mwenyego, avo wayagwe wa nzala, na wayagwe wakoligwa! <verse eid="1CO 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22"/>Kwani mwabule kae za kudila na kung'wela? Ama mowazabuza wanhu wamtogole Mulungu na kuwagela kinyala awo walibule kinhu? Niwalongele choni? Niwatogole mmbuli ino? Hata siwatogola.<verse eid="1CO 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23"/>Kwavija gano ganiwafundize mweye nigabokela kulawa ha Mndewa. Mndewa Yesu ikilo ija yaahonzigwe, kasola mkate, <verse eid="1CO 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24"/>kamuheweza Mulungu, kaumogola na kulonga, “Uno uwo lukuli lwangu lulavigwe sama yenu, tendeni vino mkunikumbukila nie.”<verse eid="1CO 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25"/>Vivija, viweshile kuja, kasola ikikasi na kulonga, “Kikasi kino kicho lagano da isambi disindiligwa na mulopa wangu, tendeni vino kila vondamung'we mkunikumbukila nie.”<verse eid="1CO 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26"/>Kwavija kila vondamje mkate uno, na kuking'wela kikasi kino, moibwililisa ifa ya Mndewa mbaka vondayeze. <verse eid="1CO 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27"/>Avo munhu yoyose yondayaje mkate uno wa Mndewa ama kuking'wela kikasi chake mnzila ileka kumuhishimila heyo, kaloza kilozo cha kuja lukuli na kung'wa mulopa wa Mndewa. <verse eid="1CO 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28"/>Avo munhu kolondigwa yaigelegeze mwenyego kipigiti hanakuja umkate na kuking'wela ikikasi. <verse eid="1CO 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29"/>Kwavija munhu yoyose yoja na kung'wa bila kuimanya nhegulo ya lukuli lwa Mndewa, koja na kung'wa nhaguso yake mwenyego. <verse eid="1CO 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30"/>Kino kicho kilamso wanhu bwando mmwanza wenu wonyolila na watamu, na wayagwe mmwanza wenu wadanganhika. <verse eid="1CO 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31"/>Ila tanhu tuhaigelegeza wenyego, hatwingila mnhaguso ya Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32"/>Ila totagusigwa na kusunigwa na Mndewa, giladi sambitwingile mnhaguso hamoja na ulumwengu.<verse eid="1CO 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33"/>Avo, ndugu zangu, muhaiting'hana hamoja kuja mandia ga Mndewa, ibeteni. <verse eid="1CO 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34"/>Kamba munhu kana nzala kolondigwa yakaje ukae yake, giladi muhaiting'hana hamoja sambimmambukizile kutagusigwa. Na vondanize, nowalongela ndagizi zisigale.<verse eid="1CO 11:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Nhunza Zilawa ha Loho wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1"/>Avo, ndugu zangu, nolonda mkumbuke mbuli ya nhunza kulawa ha Loho wa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2"/>M'vitanga kamba vumkalile Wamhazi, m'bulunyigwa na kwagizwa mkutambikila miwegu ilibule na ugima. <verse eid="1CO 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3"/>Avo nowalongela mweye kamba, haduhu munhu yolonga kubitila Loho wa Mulungu kamba “Yesu kadukumizwa,” na haduhu munhu yodaha kulonga, “Yesu iyo Mndewa,” kamba kabule Loho wa Mulungu.<verse eid="1CO 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4"/>Kuna nhunza bwando, ila Loho imwe yozilava. <verse eid="1CO 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5"/>Kuna sang'hano bwando za kusang'hana, ila Mndewa imwe. <verse eid="1CO 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6"/>Kuna nzila bwando za kusang'hanika, ila Mulungu imwe yosang'hanika mnzila zino zose mwa wanhu wose. <verse eid="1CO 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7"/>Avo kila munhu kogweleligwa lugubulo lwa Loho wa Mulungu, giladi tuitaze wenyego kwa wenyego. <verse eid="1CO 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8"/>Munhu imwe kogweleligwa udaho wa kulonga mbuli zili na ng'hungwe kubitila Loho wa Mulungu, na iyagwe kogweleligwa mbuli ya ilimu na Loho iija imwe. <verse eid="1CO 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9"/>Na munhu iyagwe kogweleligwa nhamanila na Loho iija, na iyagwe kogweleligwa nhunza ya kuhonya watamu na Loho iija imwe. <verse eid="1CO 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10"/>Na munhu iyagwe kogweleligwa nhunza ya kutenda mizonza, na iyagwe kogweleligwa nhunza ya kuhokola. Munhu iyagwe kogweleligwa nhunza ya kutanga kamba loho ino ilawa ha Mulungu ama ilawa kuyagwe, na munhu iyagwe kogweleligwa nhunza ya kulonga ulonzi wa mkanganyo, na munhu iyagwe kogweleligwa nhunza ya kutapita nhegulo ya gaja galongigwe. <verse eid="1CO 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11"/>Loho wa Mulungu yeiyeka iyo yotenda gano gose, na heyo iyo yolamula nhunza ilihi yamgwelele munhu yalihi.<verse eid="1CO 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lukuli Lumwe Luli na Vipindi Bwando</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12"/>Kamba lukuli vululi lumwe, ila luna vipindi bwando, na vipindi vose va lukuli, hata kamba va bwando, ila va lukuli lumwe, avo vivo luli na lukuli lwa Kilisto. <verse eid="1CO 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13"/>Vivija na tweye, hata kamba tuhawa Wayahudi ama Wamhazi, tuhawa nyakadala ama wailegehe, tose tubatizigwa na Loho wa Mulungu mulukuli lumwe, na tose tung'wezigwa Loho iija imwe.<verse eid="1CO 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14"/>Lukuli halutendigwe na kipindi kimwe, ila vipindi bwando. <verse eid="1CO 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15"/>Kamba mgulu uhalonga, “Kwavija nie sili mkono, nie sili wa lukuli,” mkilamso hicho kweli hauwa kipindi cha lukuli? <verse eid="1CO 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16"/>Na kamba gwiti dihalonga, “Kwavija nie sili siso, nie sili wa lukuli,” mkilamso hicho kweli hadiwa kipindi cha lukuli? <verse eid="1CO 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17"/>Kamba lukuli lose luhawile siso, munhu yahahulike vilihi? Na kamba lukuli lose luhawile gwiti, munhu yahanusile vilihi? <verse eid="1CO 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18"/>Ila Mulungu kavika goya vipindi mulukuli, kila kipindi kimwe kamba viyalondile kikale. <verse eid="1CO 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19"/>Kamba vose vihawile kipindi kimwe, lukuli luhawile kwahi? <verse eid="1CO 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20"/>Kamba viili, mulukuli kuna vipindi bwando, ila lukuli lumwe. <verse eid="1CO 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21"/>Siso hadidaha kuulongela mkono, “Sikulonda!” Na ditwi hadidaha kugalongela magulu, “Siwalonda!” <verse eid="1CO 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22"/>Ila vija ivipindi va lukuli vikoneka vabule mhiko volondigwa ng'hani. <verse eid="1CO 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23"/>Na vipindi vija vitugelegeza kamba vabule hishima, tovigwelela hishima ng'hulu, na vipindi vija vilibule unovu, tovigwaa unovu ng'hani, <verse eid="1CO 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24"/>awo vipindi vetu vinogile haviulonda. Ila Mulungu kavika hamoja vipindi vose va lukuli na kuvigwaa hishima ng'hulu vipindi vilibule unozi, <verse eid="1CO 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25"/>giladi sambikulawilile m'bagum'bagu mulukuli. Ila vipindi va lukuli volondigwa viitamanile kipindi kimwe na kiyagwe. <verse eid="1CO 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26"/>Kamba kipindi kimwe kihalumwa, vipindi vose volumwa hamoja nacho, na kamba kipindi kimwe kihahishimilwa, vipindi vose vodeng'ha hamoja nacho.<verse eid="1CO 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27"/>Avo mweye mose mwa lukuli lwa Kilisto, na kila munhu mmwanza wenu iyo kipindi chake. <verse eid="1CO 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28"/>Na mwa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto Mulungu kaweka, mosi watumigwa wa Kilisto, abaho wahokozi, abaho wafundiza, abaho wali na nhunza ya mizonza na vivija awo wali na nhunza ya kuhonya, abaho awo wali na nhunza ya kuwataza wayagwe, na awo wali na nhunza ya kuwalongoza wayagwe, na awo wolonga ulonzi wa mkanganyo. <verse eid="1CO 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29"/>Wano wose watumigwa wa Kilisto? Ama wose wahokozi? Ama wose wafundiza? Ama wose wotenda mizonza? <verse eid="1CO 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30"/>Wose wana nhunza ya kuhonya? Wose wolonga ulonzi wa mkanganyo? Wose wotapita nhegulo ya gaja galongigwe? <verse eid="1CO 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31"/>Ila sulukileni ng'hani nhunza zili ng'hulu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:31">Na nie nowalagusila nzila inogile goya.<verse eid="1CO 12:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Noge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1"/>Hata kamba nihalonga ulonzi wa kiunhu na wa wasenga wa Mulungu wa kuulanga, ila kamba nabule noge, nie na kamba zuma didesa ama debe ditoa nyangi. <verse eid="1CO 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2"/>Na hata nihawa na nhunza ya uhokozi na kuzitanga nyong'onyo zose na ilimu zose, na kamba nihawa na nhamanila idaha kuhamiza migongo, ila kamba nabule noge, nie si kinhu. <verse eid="1CO 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3"/>Kamba nihalava vinhu vangu vose na kuwagwaa wakumbulu, na kuilukuza lukuli lwangu hamoto, ila kamba nabule noge, nie sipata kinhu. <verse eid="1CO 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4"/>Noge domtenda munhu yazaganye, yawe na moyo unogile, sambiyawe na migongo, sambiyawe na matopa, <verse eid="1CO 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5"/>sambiyawe na kibuli, sambiyazahile mbuli zake mwenyego, sambiyone lusango himahima, sambiyalundize gehile. <verse eid="1CO 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6"/>Noge hadimtenda munhu yadeng'helele gehile, ila domtenda munhu yadeng'helele mbuli ya kweli. <verse eid="1CO 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7"/>Noge domtenda munhu sambiyadonhe, sambiyaileke nhamanila, yatamanile mbuli zose, na yazaganye mbuli zose.<verse eid="1CO 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8"/>Na noge dabule nziga, ila uhokozi womala, nhunza ya kulonga ulonzi wa mkanganyo yomala, na ilimu zose zobita. <verse eid="1CO 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9"/>Kwavija gatumanyile madodo, na nhunza yetu ya uhokozi yogubula madodo. <verse eid="1CO 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10"/>Ila kija kimemekezwe kihavika, kili hindi chosegela.<verse eid="1CO 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11"/>Vunikalile mwana mdodo, nikala nilonga kamba mwana mdodo, nigelegeza kamba mwana mdodo, nigesa kamba mwana mdodo, ila vunikulile, nizileka mbuli zose za haudodo. <verse eid="1CO 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12"/>Sambisambi tolola ila hatulola goya, tolola kamba munhu yolola mkiwowo, abaho, tokwiza kulola kihanga kwa kihanga. Sambisambi novitanga hadodo, abaho, nokwiza kuvitanga ng'hani, kamba vija nie vinitangigwa ng'hani.<verse eid="1CO 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13"/>Na sambisambi visigala vinhu vino vidatu, nhamanila, tamanilo, na noge. Ila kikulu kubanza vose kicho noge.<verse eid="1CO 13:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Nhunza Ziyagwe Zilawa ha Loho wa Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1"/>Dikolelezeni noge na kuiyoha sama ya nhunza za muloho, ng'haning'hani nhunza ya uhokozi. <verse eid="1CO 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2"/>Kwavija munhu yoyose yolonga ulonzi wa mkanganyo, hawalongela wanhu ila komulongela Mulungu. Kweli haduhu munhu yogamanya goyolonga, ila kozilonga nyong'onyo kubitila Loho wa Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3"/>Ila kila munhu yohokola kolonga na wanhu mbuli za kuwagela mhiko, na kuwagangamiza, na kuwabweza imioyo. <verse eid="1CO 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4"/>Munhu yolonga ulonzi wa mkanganyo koigela mhiko mwenyego, ila munhu yohokola kowagela mhiko wanhu wamtogole Kilisto.<verse eid="1CO 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5"/>Nolonda kila munhu mmwanza wenu yalonge ulonzi wa mkanganyo, ila vihanogile ng'hani kamba muhahokole. Kwavija uhokozi wowa mkulu kubanza ulonzi wa mkanganyo, kamba munhu iyagwe hatapite gaja galongigwe muulonzi wa mkanganyo giladi wanhu wose wamtogole Kilisto wafundizigwe.<verse eid="1CO 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6"/>Avo, ndugu zangu, kamba niheza kumwenu na kulonga ulonzi wa mkanganyo, kinhu chaki kinogile chondampate, kamba siwagalile lugubulo ama ilimu ama uhokozi ama mafundo? <verse eid="1CO 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7"/>Hata mbuli ya vinhu vilibule ugima vilava dizwi kamba vija filimbi ama bango, munhu koumanyaze wila utoigwa kamba mililo haiinegile? <verse eid="1CO 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8"/>Na kamba mhalati haililile goya, yalihi yondayaisasale yachole kung'hondo? <verse eid="1CO 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9"/>Vivija na mweye muhalonga ulonzi uleka kutangigwa, munhu kovitangaze gaja gamulonga? Kwavija mowa kamba vija molonga na ubeho. <verse eid="1CO 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10"/>Kweli kuna lonzi bwando muulumwengu, na haduhu hata imwe ilibule nhegulo yake. <verse eid="1CO 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11"/>Kamba siimanyile nhegulo ya kinhu choyolonga munhu, basi nie nowa kamba muhenza ha munhu ija yolonga, na heyo kowa kamba muhenza kumwangu. <verse eid="1CO 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12"/>Avo na mweye. Kwavija mosulukila kupata nhunza za muloho, iyoheni ng'hani mzipate nhunza zija ziwagangamiza wanhu wamtogole Kilisto.<verse eid="1CO 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13"/>Sama ya mbuli ino, munhu yoyose yolonga ulonzi wa mkanganyo yatambike giladi yapate udaho wa kutapita gaja goyolonga. <verse eid="1CO 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14"/>Kwavija kamba nihatambika mkulonga ulonzi wa mkanganyo, loho yangu vivija yotambika, ila nzewele zangu hazipata kinhu. <verse eid="1CO 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15"/>Avo nhendeze? Notambika muloho yangu na vivija notambika mnzewele zangu. Nokwimba muloho yangu na vivija nokwimba mnzewele zangu. <verse eid="1CO 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16"/>Kamba uhamuyenzi Mulungu muloho yako iiyeka, kodahaze munhu yokiiyona ka mmwanza wa awo hawamanyile chochose kulonga “Amina” vija vuumgwaa Mulungu hewela kipigiti hagamanya gaja gaulonga? <verse eid="1CO 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17"/>Kweli gweye komgwaa Mulungu hewela vinogile, ila munhu iyagwe hapata kinhu. <verse eid="1CO 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18"/>Nomuheweza Mulungu kwavija nie nolonga ulonzi wa mkanganyo ng'hani kubanza mweye mose. <verse eid="1CO 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19"/>Ila mwa wanhu wamtogole Kilisto, vonoga nie nilonge mbuli tano zitangika za kuwafundiza wanhu wayagwe kubanza kulonga mbuli alufu longo dimwe muulonzi wa mkanganyo.<verse eid="1CO 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20"/>Ndugu zangu, lekeni kugelegeza kamba wana wadodo. Mzimbuli zihile muwe wana wadodo, ila mngelegeza zenu muwe wakulu. <verse eid="1CO 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21"/>Mzinyandiko Zing'alile yandikigwa vino, Mndewa kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">“Mkubitila wanhu wolonga ulonzi wa kihenza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">na mmilomo ya wahenza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">nolonga na wanhu wano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CO 14:21">ila hata avo hawanitegeleza.”<verse eid="1CO 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22"/>Avo kulonga ulonzi wa mkanganyo kowa kilaguso ha awo walekile kumtogola Kilisto na sio ha awo wamtogole Kilisto, ila uhokozi sama ya awo wamtogole Kilisto na sio sama ya awo walekile kumtogola Kilisto.<verse eid="1CO 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23"/>Avo kamba wanhu wose wamtogole Kilisto wahaiting'hana hamoja na kila munhu yalonge muulonzi wa mkanganyo, na wanhu wayagwe hawazimanyile mbuli zino ama wanhu walekile kumtogola Kilisto wehengila, hawalonga kamba muna moyo? <verse eid="1CO 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24"/>Ila kamba munhu yalekile kumtogola Kilisto ama munhu hazitangile mbuli zino kengila na kum'vika kila munhu yohokola, na koneka na gose goyohulika kamba kana vilozo na kutaguswa na gose goyohulika, <verse eid="1CO 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25"/>na gaja gaifisile mmoyo wake gagubuligwa. Avo kogwa hasi na kumtambikila Mulungu na dizwi kulu na kulonga haulongozi wa wanhu, “Kweli Mulungu ka hamoja na mweye.”<verse eid="1CO 14:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Golondigwa Kutendeka Mzinhambiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26"/>Tulongeze basi, ndugu zangu! Muhaiting'hana hamoja, munhu imwe yembe wila, iyagwe yafundize, iyagwe yalave lugubulo, iyagwe yalonge ulonzi wa mkanganyo, na iyagwe yaitapite nhegulo ya gaja galongigwe. Na mbuli zino zose zitendeke sama ya kuwagela mhiko wanhu wamtogole Kilisto. <verse eid="1CO 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27"/>Kamba munhu yahalonga ulonzi wa mkanganyo, basi walonge wabili ama wadatu, sambiwabanze, tena walonge imweimwe, na munhu iyagwe yatapite nhegulo ya gaja galongigwe. <verse eid="1CO 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28"/>Kamba haduhu mtapita, munhu ija yolonga ulonzi wa mkanganyo kolondigwa yanyamale mgati ya wanhu wamtogole Kilisto ila yakiilongele heyo mwenyego na Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29"/>Wahokozi wabili ama wadatu walonge, na wayagwe wagalole goya gaja galongigwe. <verse eid="1CO 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30"/>Na kamba munhu yakalile hasi kagubuliligwa mbuli, basi ija imunhu yakalile yohokola haichanduso yanyamale. <verse eid="1CO 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31"/>Kwavija molondigwa muhokole imweimwe giladi kila munhu yafundizigwe na kugangamizwa. <verse eid="1CO 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32"/>Loho za wahokozi zowahulika wahokozi, <verse eid="1CO 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33"/>kwavija Mulungu hali Mulungu wa uvuludusi, ila ka Mulungu wa tindiwalo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Kamba viili mwa wanhu wose wang'alile wamtogole Kilisto, <verse eid="1CO 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34"/>watwanzi wolondigwa wanyamale mzinhambiko. Hawalondigwa walonge. Ila wolondigwa wategeleze kamba Malagizo ga Musa vugalonga. <verse eid="1CO 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35"/>Kamba wahalonda kutanga goya mbuli, na wawauze wambigalo zao ukae yao, kwavija kinyala ng'hani mtwanzi kulonga mnhambiko.<verse eid="1CO 14:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36"/>Mokwagiza Usenga wa Mulungu usongela kumwenu? Ama Usenga wa Mulungu uvika kumwenu mwiyeka? <verse eid="1CO 14:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37"/>Kamba munhu yahaigesa kamba heyo muhokozi, ama kana mhiko za moloho, nayatogole kamba kino kinimwandikilani mweye nyandika ndagizi kulawa ha Mndewa. <verse eid="1CO 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38"/>Ila kamba munhu yahaizabuza mbuli ino, na heyo mwenyego kozabuzwa.<verse eid="1CO 14:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39"/>Avo, ndugu zangu, sulukileni ng'hani kuhokola, na sambimgomese kulonga ulonzi wa mkanganyo. <verse eid="1CO 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40"/>Ila mbuli zino zose zitendeke vinogile kamba vuzilondigwa zikale.<verse eid="1CO 14:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Kuzuka kwa Kilisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1"/>Avo, ndugu zangu, nolonda niwakumbuse Usenga Unogile uniwapetele, awo umuubokele na amo nhamanila yenu muimile. <verse eid="1CO 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2"/>Mokomboligwa sama ya Usenga uno Unogile, kamba muhazigoga goya mbuli ziniwapetele. Kamba si vivo, nhamanila yenu yaga.<verse eid="1CO 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3"/>Kwavija nie niwagwelela mweye gaja ganogile ng'hani ganibokele. Kilisto kadanganhika sama ya vilozo vetu kamba Nyandiko Zing'alile vuzilonga. <verse eid="1CO 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4"/>Kazikigwa na mdizua da ikadatu kazusigwa kamba viyandikigwe muna Zinyandiko Zing'alile. <verse eid="1CO 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5"/>Kamulawilila Petulo, abaho na wanahina zake longo dimwe na wabili. <verse eid="1CO 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6"/>Abaho kipigiti kikija kawalawilila wanhu mia tano na malagalila, wakalile wanahina zake, wayagwe mmwanza wao wang'hali wagima mbaka kipigiti kino, ila wayagwe wadanganhika wamala.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:6 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mbaka kipigiti kino </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mbaka kipigiti Paulo viyandike lupwilili luno.</char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7"/>Abaho kamulawilila Yakobo, abaho mwa watumigwa wose wa Kilisto.<verse eid="1CO 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8"/>Hakimambukizo, kandawilila nie, kamba munhu yavumbuke mnzila haizoeleke. <verse eid="1CO 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9"/>Kwavija nie na mdodo ng'hani muna umnhongo wa watumigwa wa Kilisto, na silumbile hata kukemigwa mtumigwa kwavija niwagaza wanhu wamtogole Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10"/>Ila sama ya ngekewa ya Mulungu, niwa vino vinili, na ngekewa yake kumwangu hayagile bule, kwavija nisang'hanika kuwabanza watumigwa wose wa Kilisto, sio na udaho wangu nie ila ngekewa ya Mulungu ikalile mgati yangu. <verse eid="1CO 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11"/>Avo kamba nie ama hewo, kino kicho kitupetile, na kino kicho kimtogole.<verse eid="1CO 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Vija Vondatuzuke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12"/>Ila kamba ipetigwa kamba Kilisto kazusigwa kulawa mkudanganhika, vilihi wanhu wayagwe mmwanza wenu walonge haduhu kuzusigwa kwa wanhu wadanganhike? <verse eid="1CO 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13"/>Kamba haduhu kuzuswa kwa wanhu wadanganhike, na Kilisto na heyo hazusigwe. <verse eid="1CO 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14"/>Na kamba Kilisto hazusigwe, Usenga Unogile utuupeta mduhu kinhu, na nhamanila yetu si kinhu. <verse eid="1CO 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15"/>Kihile ng'hani, toneka kamba tweye twa wasindila wa uvwizi wa Mulungu, kwavija tumulonga Mulungu kamzusa Kilisto kulawa mkudanganhika, kumbe hamzusile kamba kweli wadanganhike hawazusigwa. <verse eid="1CO 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16"/>Avo kamba wadanganhike hawazusigwa, basi Kilisto na heyo hazusigwe. <verse eid="1CO 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17"/>Na kamba Kilisto hazusigwe, nhamanila yenu si kinhu, mng'hali m'vilozo venu. <verse eid="1CO 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18"/>Na awo wadanganhike kuno womtamanila Kilisto wapotela. <verse eid="1CO 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19"/>Kamba tomtamanila Kilisto muna uugima uno wa muulumwengu wiyeka, tolondigwa toneligwe bazi kubanza wanhu wose. <verse eid="1CO 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20"/>Ila kweli Kilisto kazusigwa kulawa mkudanganhika, waichanduso kuzusigwa mmwanza wa awo wadanganhike. <verse eid="1CO 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21"/>Kamba vija ifa vuizile kubitila munhu, vivija na kuzuswa kwa wadanganhike kwiza kubitila munhu iyagwe. <verse eid="1CO 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22"/>Kamba vija wose wakalile hamoja na Adamu viwadanganhike, vivija na awo wali hamoja na Kilisto wotendigwa kuwa wagima. <verse eid="1CO 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23"/>Ila kila munhu kozusigwa mnzamu yake, Kilisto kowa waichanduso, abaho awo wamtogole Kilisto wozusigwa mkipigiti vondayeze. <verse eid="1CO 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24"/>Abaho, ikimambukizo cha ulumwengu chokwiza, Kilisto kozihuma tawala zose, udaho wose, na mhiko zose za muloho, na kuugela Undewa mmakono ga Mulungu Tata. <verse eid="1CO 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25"/>Kwavija Kilisto kolondigwa yatawale mbaka Mulungu vondayawahume wadumuka zake wose na kuweka hasi ya magulu gake. <verse eid="1CO 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26"/>Mdumuka wa kimambukizo kubanangigwa kowa ifa. <verse eid="1CO 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27"/>Kwavija “Mulungu kavika vinhu vose hasi ya magulu gake.” Mbuli zija zilonga kamba, “Kila kinhu” kikigwa hasi yake, si kamba na Mulungu mwenyego yekile vinhu vose hasi ya Kilisto ka hasi yake Kilisto. <verse eid="1CO 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28"/>Vinhu vose vihekigwa hasi ya utawala wa Kilisto, avo Mwana mwenyego kokiika hasi ya Mulungu, ayo yavikile vinhu vose hasi ya Kilisto, na Mulungu mwenyego yawe uchana ya vinhu vose.<verse eid="1CO 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29"/>Avo kamba haduhu kuzuswa kwa wanhu wadanganhike, wotendaze wanhu waja wabatizigwe sama ya wandugu zao wadanganhike? Kamba wanhu wadanganhike hawazusigwa, habali wanhu wobatizigwa sama yao? <verse eid="1CO 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30"/>Na tweye, habali tuigela mdihonzolomo wenyego mazua gose? <verse eid="1CO 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31"/>Mazua gose, na mdihekaheka da kudanganhika, ndugu zangu! Kiniitopela kumwenu mkuilumba hamoja na Yesu Kilisto Mndewa wetu kicho kinhenda nie nilonge vino. <verse eid="1CO 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32"/>Kamba vunikala nigomba na ming'onyo ya mmuhulo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:32 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ming'onyo ya mmuhulo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">wanhu wa Efeso.</char></note> kuja Efeso sama ya kilamso cha kiunhu, choni kimhatile, kamba wanhu wadanganhike hawazusigwa? “Natuje na kung'wa, kwavija mayo todanganhika.”<verse eid="1CO 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33"/>Sambim'bunyikigwe, “Wambwiga wehile wobananga nhogolwa inogile.” <verse eid="1CO 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34"/>Bweleni mngelegeza zenu kamba vija viilondigwa, na muleke kutenda vilozo. Kwavija kuna wanhu wayagwe mmwanza wenu hawammanyile Mulungu. Nogalonga gano giladi niwagele kinyala.<verse eid="1CO 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lukuli Londaluzusigwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35"/>Munhu kodaha kuuza, “Wanhu wadanganhike wozusigwa vilihi? Na kamba wahazusigwa, wokwiza na ng'huli zilihi?” <verse eid="1CO 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36"/>Wabozi mweye! Muhahanda mbeyu muisi hayota mbaka tanhu idanganhike. <verse eid="1CO 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37"/>Uhahanda, huhanda lukuli londaloneke, ila kohanda mbeyu, mbeyu ya ngano ama kinhu kiyagwe. <verse eid="1CO 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38"/>Ila Mulungu koigwelela lukuli luyalondile mwenyego, na kila mbeyu koigwelela lukuli lwake.<verse eid="1CO 15:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39"/>Ng'huli zose hazilingane. Wanhu wana ng'huli zao, wang'onyo wana ng'huli zao, ndege wana ng'huli zao, na somba wana ng'huli zao. <verse eid="1CO 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40"/>Vivija kuna ng'huli za kuulanga na kuna ng'huli za muisi, ila yenzi ya ng'huli za kuulanga hailingile na yenzi ya ng'huli za muisi. <verse eid="1CO 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41"/>Zua dina yenzi yake, na mulenge una yenzi yake, na nhondo zina yenzi zao, na yenzi ya nhondo imwe hailingana na yenzi ya nhondo iyagwe.<verse eid="1CO 15:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42"/>Avo vino vivo vondaiwe kipigiti wanhu wadanganhike vondawazusigwe. Lukuli londalusiligwe lobanangika, na lozusigwa luja halubanangika, <verse eid="1CO 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43"/>losiligwa lubuhizwe, ila lozusigwa na yenzi, losiligwa lunyolila, ila lozusigwa na mhiko. <verse eid="1CO 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44"/>Losiligwa lukuli lwa kiunhu, ila lozusigwa lukuli lwa muloho. Kamba hana lukuli lwa kiunhu, vivija hana lukuli lwa muloho. <verse eid="1CO 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45"/>Yandikigwa muna Zinyandiko Zing'alile, kamba, “Munhu wa ichanduso, Adamu, kalumbigwa kawa munhu mwene ugima.” Ila Adamu wa ikimambukizo kawa Loho ija yowagwelele wanhu ugima. <verse eid="1CO 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46"/>Lukuli lwa muloho halulongole, ila lulongole lukuli lwa kiunhu, abaho lukuli lwa muloho. <verse eid="1CO 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47"/>Munhu wa ichanduso kalawa muisi, kalumbigwa na timbwisi, ila munhu wa ikabili kalawa kuulanga. <verse eid="1CO 15:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48"/>Kamba viyakalile munhu kulawa muisi, vivo wali awo wali muisi, na kamba viyakalile munhu kulawa kuulanga, vivo wali awo wali kuulanga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wanhu wali kuulanga wao wanhu wamtogole Kilisto. </char></note> <verse eid="1CO 15:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49"/>Na kamba vija vituilingile na munhu ija yolawa muisi, avo tokwiza kuilinga na munhu ija yolawa kuulanga.<verse eid="1CO 15:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50"/>Ndugu zangu, nowalongela kamba ng'huli zetu hazidaha kuuhala Undewa wa Mulungu, tena ng'huli zino zibanangika hazidaha kuhala gaja hagabanangikaga.<verse eid="1CO 15:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51"/>Tegelezeni, niwalongele nyong'onyo. Hatudanganhika tose, ila tose togaluka <verse eid="1CO 15:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52"/>hima, kamba kubalika kwa siso, kuna imhalati ya zua da ikimambukizo. Kwavija mhalati yolila, wanhu wadanganhike wozuka wowa wagima gunge na gunge, na tweye tuli wagima togaluka. <verse eid="1CO 15:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53"/>Kwavija ng'huli zetu zino zidanganhika zolondigwa zigaluke ziwe ng'huli zileka kudanganhika, na ng'huli zetu zino zibanangika zolondigwa zigaluke ziwe ng'huli zileka kubanangika. <verse eid="1CO 15:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54"/>Ng'huli zetu zino zidanganhika zihagaluka kuwa ng'huli zileka kudanganhika, avo ulonzi uja wandikigwe Mzinyandiko Zing'alile wowa kweli, ulonga, “Ifa imezigwa na mhuma.” <verse eid="1CO 15:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55"/>Ifa, ili kwahi mhuma yako? Ifa, uli kwahi usungu wako?<verse eid="1CO 15:55"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56"/>Ifa yopata mhiko za kulumiza kulawa m'vilozo, na vilozo vopata mhiko kulawa Mmalagizo ga Musa. <verse eid="1CO 15:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57"/>Ila hewela zim'vikile Mulungu, ayo yatugwelele mhuma kubitila Mndewa wetu Yesu Kilisto.<verse eid="1CO 15:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58"/>Avo, ndugu zangu wanogelwa, nanahileni, sambimtigiswe na kinhu chochose, mazua gose ilaveni mmioyo ing'alile kuitenda sang'hano ya Mndewa, kwavija m'vimanya kamba kusang'hanika kumsang'hanika sama ya Mndewa sio jaga bule.<verse eid="1CO 15:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Msango wa Kuwasangila Wanhu Wamtogole Kilisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1"/>Muimbuli ya msango wa kuwasangila wanhu wa Mulungu ako Yelusalemu, tendeni kamba vuniwalongele watende wanhu wamtogole Kilisto kuja kuisi ya Galatia. <verse eid="1CO 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2"/>Mdizua da mwanduso wa kila wiki,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:2 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Zua da mwanduso wa wiki </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nhegulo yake </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">jumapili.</char></note> kila munhu yeke hamgwazo kiasi cha hela kulingana na vija viyopata, avo niheza sambikuwe na msango wowose wondautendeke. <verse eid="1CO 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3"/>Abaho, nihavika, nowagwelela mhwilili za kuwatambula wanhu waja imuwasagule kugala nhunza zenu Yelusalemu. <verse eid="1CO 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4"/>Kamba vihanoga nie kuchola na hewo, basi tochola tose.<verse eid="1CO 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngelegeza za Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5"/>Nokwiza kumwenu mkubitila muisi ya Makedonia, kwavija nolondigwa nibitile Makedonia. <verse eid="1CO 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6"/>Siku nokala na mweye kidogo ama mkipigiti chose cha kihuhe, giladi mnhaze mmwanza wangu kokose kunichola. <verse eid="1CO 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7"/>Silonda kukiiyona namwe sambisambi kuno nibita nzila, kwavija notamanila kukala namwe mkipigiti kitali kamba vihamnogela Mulungu. <verse eid="1CO 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8"/>Ila nogendelela kukala hano mdiwambo da Efeso mbaka zua da lusona lwa Pentekoste, <verse eid="1CO 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9"/>kwavija nipata kipigiti kinogile cha kusang'hanika, ila hana wanhu bwando wonibeza. <verse eid="1CO 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10"/>Kamba Timoteo yeheza kumwenu, loleni kamba haduhu kinhu chochose chondakimdumbize kipigiti chondayawe na mweye, kwavija koisang'hana sang'hano ya Mndewa kamba vija vunitenda nie. <verse eid="1CO 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11"/>Avo munhu yoyose sambiyamzabuze, ila msindikizeni mditindiwalo giladi yabwele kumwangu, mana nomulolela heyo na wanhu wayagwe wamtogole Kilisto.<verse eid="1CO 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12"/>Tuilole mbuli ya Apolo. Nimuyalalila ng'hani yeze kumwenu hamoja na wandugu wayagwe, ila halondile kwiza kipigiti kino, ila kokwiza yahapata nafasi. <verse eid="1CO 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13"/>Kaleni meso, nanahileni mnhamanila, gangamaleni, muwe na mhiko. <verse eid="1CO 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14"/>Tendeni mbuli zose mdinoge.<verse eid="1CO 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15"/>Muutanga mulango wa Stefana wakala wanhu wamtogole Kilisto waichanduso kuja kuisi ya Akaya, na wasagula wenyego kuwasang'hanikila wanhu wa Mulungu. Ndugu zangu, nowayalalila, <verse eid="1CO 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16"/>wategelezeni wanhu kamba wano na kila munhu yoilumba na hewo muisang'hano na kusang'hanika hamoja na hewo.<verse eid="1CO 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17"/>Ninogelwa ng'hani avija viwavikile kina Stefana na Fotunata na Akaiko, kwavija wanigwelela vinhu vinihonyile kulawa kumwenu, <verse eid="1CO 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18"/>kwavija wausuluza moyo wangu na vivija mioyo yenu. Wanhu kamba wano wolondigwa kutambuligwa.<verse eid="1CO 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19"/>Wanhu wamtogole Kilisto muna iisi ya Asia wowalamsa. Akuila na Pilisila hamoja na wanhu wamtogole Kilisto woiting'hana mng'anda yao wowalamsa ng'hani mditwaga da Mndewa. <verse eid="1CO 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20"/>Wandugu wose hano wowalamsa. Ilamseni wenyego kwa wenyego na mnonelo ung'alile.<verse eid="1CO 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21"/>Nie Paulo, nokwandika ndamsa ino na mkono wangu mwenyego.<verse eid="1CO 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22"/>Kamba munhu yoyose yoleka kumnogela Mndewa, yadukumizwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 16:22">“Malanata!” Mndewa wetu, izo!<verse eid="1CO 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23"/>Ngekewa ya Mndewa Yesu iwe hamoja na mweye.<verse eid="1CO 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24"/>Noge jangu diwe na mweye mose mkuilumba hamoja na Yesu Kilisto.<verse eid="1CO 16:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16"/>
</usx>
